  "parameters": {
   "MOE_ACTIVATION": "activation family: 0 SwiGLU silu(gate)*up, 1 SwiGLU with alpha / beta gate*sigmoid(alpha*gate)*(up+beta), 2 situ beta*tanh(gate/beta)*sigmoid(gate)*up' with up' = lb*tanh(up/lb) (up when lb = 0)",
