   "MOE_MAX_ROWS": "max tokens per rank per call (multiple of 128)",
   "MOE_RANKS": "expert-parallel world size (ranks of the EP group)",
   "MOE_RETURN_CODEC": "return codec of the expert results: 0 lossless BF16, 1 int8 with a BF16 scale per 64 values",
